    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Choreographer Ohad Naharin, an unparalleled voice in contemporary dance, is back at NDT. In ZŌ, performed by NDT 1 and set in our NDT Black Box, the boundaries between audience and dancers blur, creating an intimate experience like no other. For now all tickets are sold out. Join the waiting list and you’ll receive an&hellip;"
